SY_TALK("GXWoo1obsCM",[[0,["Today we are here, all of us, to celebrate","a four day festival called as Diwali."]],[15,["Diwali comes from the word ‘dipali’; ‘dipali’","in Sanskrit."]],[18,["The word ‘deepa’ means ‘the lights’,","and ‘ali’ means the ‘line’, the ‘rows’."]],[26,["Now, there are many things that have happened","during these four days and that’s how it"]],[33,["is celebrated with such a great enthusiasm."]],[45,["The first thing is the day of the Lakshmi’s","birth."]],[50,["That is the thirteenth day of the moon, “dhanteras’","they call it."]],[54,["[Which] is the real day when Lakshmi was born","out of the sea; that’s why She is called"]],[65,["as Miriam or Maryam."]],[68,["The word ‘Marie’ or ‘Marine’, also","comes from the word ‘sea’."]],[80,["So, She’s born out of the sea, She’s created","out of the sea."]],[91,["And the wealth of the sea, so far, thank God,","human beings have not yet exploited."]],[101,["But they may, one day, start doing that also."]],[105,["And a lot of wealth is still there, so when","people start getting worried about exhausting"]],[111,["the Mother Earth, we must know that sea is","much more than the Earth is, so nothing is"]],[120,["exhausted."]],[121,["Still there is such a lot in reserve for you,","and one should not worry as to the supply"]],[130,["of wealth that can come from the sea."]],[136,["Now, this Lakshmi is the goddess who stands","on the lotus."]],[146,["She represents all the well-being, the wealth,","the glory of wealth, the decoration of wealth;"]],[171,["whichever is auspicious."]],[175,["Whatever is not auspicious is not wealth according","to Sahaja Yoga, or according to any scripture."]],[181,["It is not wealth at all."]],[183,["So She is a lady who stands on a lotus: showing","that a person, who has got wealth, has to"]],[194,["be a person who doesn’t assert his pressures","on people, who doesn’t push people around,"]],[203,["who doesn’t pressurise."]],[206,["And then She’s a lady, She’s a mother."]],[211,["So wealth, is the first opening to our seeking."]],[225,["But when you start seeking the wealth, you","realise that the superficial wealth that you"]],[229,["are seeking is not sufficient, is not going","to give you complete joy."]],[234,["So you start seeking the deeper wealth."]],[238,["As I said that: on the Mother Earth you have","exploited all that is possible [but] still"]],[242,["there, deep down in the sea, a lot of wealth","is still there."]],[246,["So then the seeking moves towards the deeper","seeking."]],[253,["So the same Lakshmi becomes Mahalakshmi."]],[257,["When you start expanding yourself to higher","and deeper, valuable things then this Lakshmi"]],[266,["doesn’t lure you much: She’s just there","for your glory, but not for your satisfaction."]],[276,["The wealth is there for distribution only."]],[280,["You enjoy the…there’s no word for ‘dhan’","[in English] I think?"]],[288,["Yogi: Generosity."]],[289,["Shri Mataji: Oh, “generosity’!"]],[292,["But generosity is different."]],[296,["But what I’m saying [is] generous fondness."]],[301,["It’s a fondness that you should be generous."]],[304,["Sometimes it’s a very great"]],[318,["happiness and joy that you feel — that is","the greatest — when you are generous, when"]],[325,["you give away."]],[326,["That’s a fondness, that’s a kind of a","human expression of one’s own being: that"]],[332,["you want to be generous."]],[335,["And this generosity only can come when Mahalakshmi","principle is born in you."]],[339,["But at Lakshmi principle also She stands like","this; Her hand is like this one: as giving."]],[349,["And the other is like this."]],[351,["So miserliness is not a sign of wealth."]],[352,["I mean, if you are miserly that means you","are not wealthy."]],[356,["If you are really wealthy, why will you be","miserly?"]],[360,["This simple question is there."]],[365,["That means if you are really wealthy, you","will just give away."]],[371,["If you cannot give away, then you are poor,","you are a beggar."]],[373,["[If] you are still hankering after that, that","means you are still a beggar, and you are"]],[379,["hankering for it."]],[380,["So [with] this left hand She is giving all","the time, and with the right hand She protects"]],[385,["people."]],[386,["She gives protection to people."]],[390,["The wealth must give protection to people,","in the way [that] it must look after the well"]],[400,["being of others, not your own self-indulgence:","like having all the best things to yourself"]],[409,["while others are starving."]],[410,["That’s not a sign of a wealthy man."]],[414,["A wealthy man is a person who knows that,","unless and until he shares his things with"]],[421,["others, he is not going to be happy, ultimately."]],[423,["For the time being he may be."]],[428,["People live with imbalances, they live with","wrong ideas."]],[429,["But ultimately they have to correct it."]],[434,["If they do not correct this, there are problems."]],[438,["Then there’s upheaval, lots of changes come","in."]],[442,["People start seeing that, “Oh, this doesn’t","work out, that doesn’t work out.\""]],[447,["The children run away from the houses, the","family goes into problems."]],[454,["All sorts of things happen, and then they","realise, “This is the reason: I have been"]],[459,["very miserly."]],[460,["I have not been generous."]],[461,["I have not been using money for the sake of","others.\""]],[466,["Now, after coming to Sahaja Yoga, you become","a Divine person."]],[470,["Definitely you become Divine."]],[471,["You are now a Divine personality, you are","not a human personality."]],[475,["So you have to give up all that is human within","you, then only you will be fully Divine."]],[479,["But it’s very difficult."]],[481,["That’s [what] the problem is: that it is","very difficult to really accept that you are"]],[487,["Divine, and that you have to take to Divine","policies and Divine attitudes, and Divine"]],[492,["temperament."]],[493,["Now, the Divine temperament is generous."]],[496,["It is not bothered, as to what happens next."]],[499,["It’s not bothered, because it is connected","with the Source."]],[503,["If you give one you will get a hundred."]],[505,["It is sure about it."]],[511,["And to a Divine person, worldly things have","no meaning, if they cannot give pleasures"]],[516,["to others."]],[517,["A person who is very self-indulgent, always","bothered about himself, is not a Divine person"]],[521,["at all."]],[522,["In no way he’s Divine."]],[525,["It’s very common."]],[526,["It’s human."]],[527,["Everybody does that."]],[529,["Everybody is self-preserving."]],[530,["But after Sahaja Yoga, you do not start all","this nonsense again; you give it up."]],[535,["And who looks after you?"]],[539,["Who looks after your self-preservation?"]],[542,["Is God Almighty."]],[544,["You are now completely dedicated to Him, and","He looks after you."]],[550,["You don’t have to worry as to how to look","after yourself, how to do this, how to do"]],[557,["that."]],[558,["It is His work."]],[559,["The more you go on worrying about yourself,","the worse it will be."]],[562,["The moment you give it up, it is looked after."]],[566,["Many Sahaja Yogis must have experienced this","in their lifetime: that when they try to give"]],[570,["it up, they get all the help from God; but","whenever they try to assert, and worry about"]],[576,["their well-being and things like that, then","there is a problem."]],[580,["You don’t know from where the help comes","in."]],[583,["And we have had so many examples, so many","so-called miracles, where people wanted to"]],[590,["do something, and suddenly they got the money","from somewhere they least expected."]],[595,["So for a Divine person, the attitude should","be of giving and of protection: protect."]],[608,["Now, we are very good at protecting our bhoots,","and protecting others who are bhoots."]],[618,["You see, the sympathies always go to bhoots,","because they have a way of creating a sympathetic"]],[624,["attitude in your heart."]],[626,["So you start looking after that person because","that person looks so much miserable."]],[634,["You have to protect the saints."]],[637,["You have to protect the principle of God,","the Divinity in others, and not the bhoots."]],[644,["You are not here to care for all the bhoots","of the world."]],[648,["So the idea of Lakshmi must be understood","in a proper way."]],[652,["In Sahaja Yoga it’s a very different thing","from all other people know about; like charity."]],[662,["Like, people say now, “We must be charitable,","start a charitable organisation.\""]],[665,["In that, you look after this kind of people,","that kind of people."]],[671,["We are not bothered."]],[672,["That’s not [what] you are given Realisation","for: to look after every sort of a person."]],[677,["You are here to look after all the saints","and all born-realised children."]],[684,["And you are not to bother about people who","do not matter to God and Divine."]],[688,["When they came to Realisation, if they get","Realisation, if they become saints, all right."]],[692,["But you don’t worry about every Dick, Tom","and Harry, on the street: “Oh Mother, he’s"]],[699,["so miserable!” and this and that."]],[702,["So the charity must be understood in a Divine","light."]],[706,["And the Divine light will give you discretion,","to understand whom to be charitable [to]."]],[713,["You have to be charitable to your brothers","and sisters."]],[717,["You have to be kind to them."]],[718,["Now you will say: “What about worrying about,","Mother, people who are starving?"]],[723,["Who are this?”"]],[724,["That’s not your headache!"]],[726,["Why should you do their jobs?"]],[728,["You are all good at doing others’ jobs."]],[731,["For example, you are driving in the car: “Oh,","look at this!"]],[736,["There should have been this properly done!"]],[739,["That they should have done properly!” but","that’s not your job!Why should you waste"]],[745,["your energy in finding out what the others","should have done?"]],[748,["You should do what you have to do."]],[750,["And don’t waste your energy in these things."]],[753,["You see, [in] all these charitable institutions,","I have seen [that] those people who work there"]],[757,["are very difficult for Realisation."]],[759,["This is the proof of the pudding."]],[763,["Because to whom to do the charity?"]],[765,["If there is no other person, you do not do","charity to anyone!"]],[769,["I mean, sitting down here, I can do charities","to people, so-called, which are not charities,"]],[775,["they are part and parcel of my being."]],[776,["I just do it, because they are part and parcel","of my being."]],[779,["I don’t have to go all out to sacrifice","something to do charity, because that’s"]],[786,["nothing but ego pampering and ego-oriented:","“Oh, I have helped this man, and how dare"]],[795,["he say such a thing!”"]],[799,["So this is one quality of the Divine, one","should know, that It is generous."]],[803,["It is generous to a fault, to a fault."]],[813,["It is generous because It is generous."]],[815,["It is not bothered."]],[816,["It doesn’t reason out Itself: “Why should","I be generous?”"]],[819,["It is generous because It is; because it’s","the whim, it’s a fondness."]],[824,["The fondness of generosity is such, as you","have fondness, say, people have fondness to"]],[829,["drink, for example let’s say."]],[831,["That’s not fondness, that’s a habit, I","think."]],[834,["But you can say some fondness people have."]],[838,["What kind of a fondness you have, without","forming a habit, I don’t know."]],[841,["Because you always have a habit and then you","form the fondness."]],[844,["But supposing you just have a fondness."]],[849,["For example, you are fond of, say, good food,","let us take it."]],[860,["Now, if you have fondness of good food, then","you will just do it because you are fond of"]],[867,["it."]],[868,["Now if somebody says, “Why are you fond","of good food?”"]],[871,["You said, “I am just fond – finished!"]],[873,["Who are you to ask me such a question?”"]],[875,["If somebody is fond of generosity, he will","be generous whether you like it or not."]],[881,["And it is sometimes, to a reasonable man,","may look to be a bit too much."]],[887,["The greatest generosity a human being can","do is to forgive."]],[891,["I mean, it’s not generosity to others but","to yourself."]],[898,["If you forgive others you are generous to","yourself."]],[900,["First of all be generous to yourself, that","is you forgive everybody else."]],[905,["If you forgive everybody else, then you are","not tortured by them; you spare yourself from"]],[914,["their tortures."]],[915,["This is a generosity towards yourself."]],[919,["Towards yourself, the greatest generosity","is that you do not bear any malice or bitterness"]],[926,["about anyone."]],[927,["But clear-cut ideas that, “He’s like this","and he is like this.\""]],[930,["Just a clear-cut idea, but no reaction out","of it."]],[936,["If somebody is a man, say, he’s bhootish:","all right he’s a bhootish fellow, we know"]],[941,["he’s a bhootish, keep yourself in bandhan,","but don’t have a reaction out of that."]],[946,["Then you have really forgiven everyone."]],[951,["Forgiveness gives you a big kavacha; is a","big bandhan, is a big protection, we can say,"]],[957,["a shield, from all kinds of evil that other’s","can put on you."]],[964,["Just forgive them, and then you see what happens","to them."]],[968,["You just try this trick: just forgive, and","see what happens to others who try to torture"]],[975,["you."]],[976,["Of course, the Divine never wants to torture","anyone; that is definite."]],[980,["It never wants to torture."]],[983,["It is extremely generous, It likes to forgive."]],[986,["It enjoys Its forgiveness, It really enjoys."]],[987,["Generosity is to be enjoyed in the same way","forgiveness is to be enjoyed."]],[994,["It’s very enjoyable."]],[996,["When you forgive others it’s the most enjoyable","thing, that you see the play, you become the"]],[1003,["witness."]],[1004,["So the Mahalakshmi tattwa, when it develops","into you: first of all you have to forgive"]],[1010,["if somebody has borrowed money from you and","has not returned — it doesn’t matter."]],[1017,["It’s difficult for people to forgive people","who borrow money and don’t give."]],[1024,["(laughter) And beyond that is also another","problem I have seen (laughing) that: if you"]],[1032,["lend some money to somebody, then run away","from that person."]],[1036,["Because even to give is easier, but [to] take","is even worse."]],[1039,["A person who takes money from you, will never","forgive you all your life, because you have"]],[1045,["lent money to him!"]],[1049,["So, one has to understand that, when you become","Divine, you just give."]],[1054,["You just give."]],[1056,["This is Mahalakshmi tattwa."]],[1059,["Mahalakshmi tattwa is that you give."]],[1063,["Don’t worry about what is the result, how","others react to it, what happens to it, what"]],[1070,["is the ultimate result, and what you achieve","out of it, and how the person has taken."]],[1074,["Just give!"]],[1075,["That is Mahalakshmi tattwa."]],[1077,["But when I say give, also you must use discretion."]],[1084,["That is the part we always forget."]],[1087,["Sahaja Yoga must teach you discretion, that","is the Divine truth."]],[1094,["Divine is the most discreet thing."]],[1096,["Now, when I say, “Give,” I know people","will just start running on the street, finding"]],[1102,["out somebody where you can give something!"]],[1107,["You don’t have to run about to find out","somebody that you should give something to"]],[1114,["someone: there’s no need."]],[1116,["It’s just flowing."]],[1118,["It’s just flowing."]],[1119,["Whenever the chance is, just try to give:","material things, something kind words, sweetness,"]],[1131,["comfort."]],[1132,["But never give one thing, which I sometimes","do by mistake: never give advice! (laughter)"]],[1140,["That’s a very dangerous thing."]],[1154,["You can give bandhan, you can beat the person","at his back with shoes."]],[1160,["But never give an advice in words."]],[1165,["That is one of the principles of Sahaja Yoga,","for the time being."]],[1170,["Because giving advice, you know what it means."]],[1174,["You may have a boxed nose or something!"]],[1176,["It’s a very dangerous thing."]],[1180,["So best is, on that part I would say, as far","as advice is concerned: you have so many ways"]],[1186,["and methods of handling a situation."]],[1189,["So better not speak about it, just handle","it in complete silence."]],[1194,["Whatever you have to do about a person, just","handle him without talking to that person."]],[1202,["The more you try to convince the person, the","worse he will get."]],[1206,["Because they are not Divine."]],[1208,["They haven’t reached that Divinity."]],[1211,["They are a special type of people who cannot","become Divine, and do not break your necks"]],[1219,["with them."]],[1220,["Also don’t give advice to other Sahaja yogis."]],[1223,["Everybody at this stage thinks that they know","all about Sahaja Yoga."]],[1228,["It’s all right, good idea!"]],[1231,["Very good idea!"]],[1233,["But never try to tell them what they should","do, what is good for them, unless and until"]],[1240,["they come and ask."]],[1242,["Now, this Mahalakshmi tattwa, when it grows","into collectivity: what happens [is] that"]],[1252,["you learn that you have to just give, and","you don’t worry about the receiving."]],[1257,["As Krishna has said, “Karmanye vadhikaraste","phaleshou Ma kadachana” (meaning) “Our"]],[1261,["job is to do the karmas (the work) and we","are not to worry about the phalas (fruits).\""]],[1267,["Just try to give whatever is possible to everyone:","vibrations, Realisation."]],[1276,["I know it is wasted so many times — you","give Realisation and it is wasted."]],[1280,["It’s like the seeds that are thrown on the","rocks."]],[1283,["Yes, I know, it is."]],[1286,["So many times I have wasted thousands of them,","but doesn’t matter, you give them."]],[1291,["It is not [that] you are giving them for their","sake, but for your sake."]],[1295,["It is for your satisfaction you are doing","it, for your fondness you are doing it."]],[1302,["So just try to give Realisation to everyone,","anyone who asks for it."]],[1309,["But, as Christ has rightly said that, “Don’t","throw pearls before the swines.\""]],[1314,["I mean, I shouldn’t use this word today,","on such an auspicious day, but doesn’t matter."]],[1321,["So, this, He has said it."]],[1323,["Now, this kind of people, who are they?"]],[1325,["They are the people who don’t deserve it."]],[1329,["So there is no need to give Realisation to","every person you come across [or] talk to"]],[1336,["everyone."]],[1337,["Gradually you will meet such people who will","ask for Sahaja Yoga, for Realisation: you’ll"]],[1342,["give it to them."]],[1344,["Gradually those pigs, or what you call them,","whatever Christ has called them, they will"]],[1353,["evolve, I am sure, one day, and they’ll","come to you."]],[1358,["So, let us try on the first level, where there","are genuine seekers of a high level, and you"]],[1367,["will be amazed how they are sorted out."]],[1372,["You see, there isn’t much space in the Kingdom","of God, to be very frank."]],[1377,["And we should not worry if we don’t have","many people over there."]],[1383,["For us, it is a responsibility we must have","all the population of this world going up"]],[1390,["there: is a wrong idea."]],[1392,["That’s not needed at all."]],[1394,["We should not crowd them there."]],[1396,["Here only, we can’t sit all of us you see,","we’ll have to have a bigger place."]],[1401,["So we should not bother so much as to the","quantity, that the quantity is not much."]],[1408,["Of course we should try our level best to","pass the message; Because they should not"]],[1412,["say that, “We didn’t get the message.\""]],[1414,["To pass the message is all right."]],[1416,["But we need not in any way force people or","ask them to come to Sahaja Yoga or make them"]],[1424,["Sahaja Yogis."]],[1425,["It’s a difficult thing."]],[1426,["The more you will try, the worse they will","be."]],[1429,["They will be so troublesome that it’s going","to be an impossible task."]],[1436,["So in your generosity you must have discretion:","how far to go with people, how far to work"]],[1444,["it out."]],[1445,["This is the Mahalakshmi tattwa which comes","to you as a result of Shri Ganesha, who blesses"]],[1453,["you with wisdom as to how to be generous with","others, where to give, what to give."]],[1460,["The discretion starts working."]],[1461,["You don’t have to think about it, it just","works out."]],[1466,["It will just work out."]],[1467,["Discretion in Sahaja Yoga doesn’t mean,","at all, thinking or rationally coming to a"]],[1473,["conclusion, but it means that it just works","out that way: in the sense that you feel it"]],[1479,["in your vibratory awareness."]],[1480,["Once such a discretion is developed, you will","be amazed that those who are not to enter"]],[1494,["into the Kingdom of God will just shun it,","will not come close to you."]],[1499,["And it’s better for us, less headache, you","see."]],[1503,["Because they think that we need them, while","they don’t know [that] they need Realisation,"]],[1509,["not we."]],[1510,["We have got our Realisation."]],[1511,["So this is about generosity, today, I wanted","to tell you; about being generous to Sahaja"]],[1519,["Yogis."]],[1520,["Now, I’m not going to tell you that you","go on giving presents to Sahaja Yogis and"]],[1525,["all that, because, as you know that, these","material things have no value except they"]],[1529,["have symbolic value."]],[1530,["And symbolically if you work for them, and","if symbolically if you try to express yourself,"]],[1538,["it is going to work out much better than in","a material way: that it should be so expensive,"]],[1546,["it should be so much."]],[1547,["That’s not good."]],[1549,["Symbolically you should work out material","gifts and things among yourselves."]],[1555,["But the main thing one should understand [is]","that collectivity will only grow when you"]],[1560,["do not, by any of your attitude or behaviour,","suggest that others are lower than you or"]],[1565,["others are higher than you."]],[1568,["For example, you see something straight, you","see quite far away; I see much more than what"]],[1577,["you can see."]],[1579,["It’s a fact."]],[1580,["You know that."]],[1581,["But I don’t tell you."]],[1582,["I just say, “I don’t know, maybe try this,","try that.\""]],[1585,["I keep quiet."]],[1587,["I just try to play about."]],[1590,["I say, “All right."]],[1591,["Let’s see.\""]],[1592,["I’ll consult you, I’ll consult him, everybody","I’ll consult: “All right, try this.\""]],[1595,["Or I’ll do all these tricks, because I don’t","want you to feel that, “Mother knows everything,"]],[1600,["so why should I know?”"]],[1601,["First of all you can say that."]],[1603,["Or you may say that, “Mother knows so much,","and I know nothing."]],[1607,["I can never reach Her.\""]],[1610,["So, what you have to do is to make another","person see as much as you see."]],[1616,["How will you do that?"]],[1618,["By being with him all the time, by being in","such a relationship that the other doesn’t"]],[1623,["feel the oppression: oppression of that personality,","as if that person [thinks], “Oh, he is so"]],[1634,["great, he is so great, he knows so many things,","and he’s so evolved."]],[1638,["What are we?"]],[1639,["We are nothing!”"]],[1642,["If you develop such an attitude towards a","person, then the other person can also develop"]],[1649,["another attitude, just the other way round."]],[1652,["That he’ll oppose such a person, he’ll","stand out, he’ll be angry all the time."]],[1656,["At the slightest pretext, he’ll be off and","he’ll feel hurt and he’ll be miserable."]],[1661,["All these things can come up."]],[1663,["So it is not going to help you, nor the other","person."]],[1666,["But to tell another person, if you want to","raise that person higher, the best thing is"]],[1672,["to make him your friend, your dearest person,","and let him see as much as you can see, together."]],[1683,["Then the vision is broader."]],[1687,["It’s not that one person sees something","more and others do not see, and the person"]],[1695,["who can see, thinks no end of himself."]],[1699,["You should behave in such a manner as if you","don’t know anything, it’s better."]],[1705,["You should see me, how I behave."]],[1707,["I don’t tell you anything, I just say, “All","right, go ahead."]],[1711,["Whatever you think proper, do it.\""]],[1713,["Then you come round and you say, “Mother","but it happened like this, and you had told"]],[1714,["us this way!”"]],[1715,["So I say, “I told you, all right, but I","didn’t say, “All right, this is going"]],[1721,["to happen!’"]],[1722,["” But it happens."]],[1723,["So it’s better that you should also develop","that kind of an attitude that, all of us have"]],[1729,["to go together."]],[1730,["There’s nobody who can just pull out oneself","ahead."]],[1733,["We all have to go together, even me."]],[1738,["Even if I maybe anything, what does it matter?"]],[1740,["What does it matter if God is great?"]],[1743,["So what?"]],[1744,["He may be great in His own play."]],[1748,["But what do we gain out of Him is the point","that, His greatness should be seen through"]],[1754,["us."]],[1755,["If we cannot move up to that point, what’s","the use of His greatness?"]],[1759,["It’s better that He’s away."]],[1761,["He’s too great for us."]],[1765,["So He has to come down."]],[1766,["He has to come down to this level to make","everybody feel that they are part and parcel"]],[1773,["of His own ignorance."]],[1774,["He may be the most knowledgeable person, so","what?"]],[1777,["You have to take the cover of the ignorance","upon yourself and go on slowly exposing yourself."]],[1784,["In the same way, if you can do it with other","Sahaja Yogis."]],[1792,["Then only you could be good leaders, and you","have been really generous with a full discretion."]],[1799,["So today’s day is, as I told you, the thirteenth","day is the Goddess."]],[1808,["Dhanteras it is called as."]],[1810,["That is the day of the Gruha Lakshmi; She","came as Gruha Lakshmi."]],[1813,["In the household, the lady is the one who","is the symbol of that Lakshmi, to begin with."]],[1823,["Because she’s the one who looks after your","food, looks after your comfort, she protects"]],[1828,["you, she nourishes you, she gives you joy."]],[1833,["And the women who cannot do that are not Gruhalakshmis."]],[1837,["They are not the…’housewife’ is a very","poor word for that."]],[1842,["They are the Gruhalakshmis; means they are","the goddesses of the family."]],[1848,["So, the other day we were in America."]],[1850,["I told the girls, I said, “Let us wait."]],[1854,["And what we can do: it’s all right, I am","the Mother; you can give me food if you want."]],[1858,["But I don’t mind, give the boys first, and","then the girls should eat.\""]],[1861,["And one of them got very angry with me."]],[1863,["She said, “Mother what is this?"]],[1865,["They are dominating us!”"]],[1867,["If somebody eats before or later, what is","the domination?"]],[1870,["I mean, in any case you are going to eat before","or after!"]],[1874,["I don’t understand the portion of domination."]],[1876,["But you are privileged!"]],[1878,["You are privileged that you can look after","so many people!"]],[1887,["What is so wrong in it?"]],[1888,["You see the whole atmosphere is so funny that","if the men eat first, then women should feel"]],[1896,["that we are put down."]],[1899,["It’s absurd, because it’s a privilege:","you are like a mother."]],[1904,["You are the person who has to look after them,","and you have to feed them."]],[1908,["It’s a privilege that a Gruhalakshmi should","do that: look after everybody, give them food"]],[1914,["to eat and treat them just like their protégés","you can say, something like that."]],[1920,["It’s such a privilege."]],[1922,["It’s a sign of complete maturity."]],[1925,["Even little, little girls, you have seen,","if they are brought up properly, otherwise"]],[1930,["they can be horrifying."]],[1931,["But normally little girls are very generous,","more generous than men are."]],[1935,["And they always try to make you very happy."]],[1940,["They have great sense."]],[1943,["If somebody is sitting down they’ll come","and give you food and look after you."]],[1947,["I mean, I have seen my all three granddaughters,","do that."]],[1951,["Even once a washerwoman came in the house."]],[1953,["They said, “You must sit on the sofa.\""]],[1954,["She said, “But no, I can’t."]],[1955,["I can’t sit on the sofa.\""]],[1956,["“No, you must sit on the sofa!” they said."]],[1959,["They opened the fan for her and they brought","all the things that were in the kitchen for"]],[1964,["her to eat, now, and they brought some plate","and this and that."]],[1969,["And the elder one, I told her, “What do","you want to be?”"]],[1971,["She said, “I can only be a nurse or an air","hostess.\""]],[1978,["I said, “Why?"]],[1979,["Air hostess and nurse, why?”"]],[1981,["“Because these are the only two professions","where one can give, isn’t it, food.\""]],[1988,["I mean it’s a privilege."]],[1991,["Other professions you can’t do this great","job, this noble job, of giving food."]],[1995,["“So that’s why I want to be either the","nurse or the air hostess.\""]],[2002,["And they play, I have seen these girls play,","“Now I’m the air hostess, now."]],[2007,["You must eat this!”"]],[2008,["They bring food in small, little things."]],[2014,["They make their own things, “Now I’m the","air hostess,” and they’ll bring it."]],[2017,["Now, there may not be any food in it, maybe","some stones they have put, or whatever it"]],[2020,["is."]],[2021,["“You must eat!"]],[2022,["You must look after yourself!"]],[2023,["You are thinning down."]],[2024,["You’d better.\""]],[2025,["Like that: so sweet."]],[2026,["And then they’ll bring some pillows, “Now","you must lie down.\""]],[2030,["Like the air hostesses they are working, you","see, “Ah, are you feeling cold?"]],[2034,["Would you like to have a blanket or something?”"]],[2036,["I said, “What game is this?”"]],[2038,["“Now we are air hostesses!” (laughter)"]],[2041,["It’s such a privilege, an innocent privilege."]],[2044,["And that’s what, if we develop, this nonsense","of a right that, “We are higher, they are"]],[2051,["lower,” all this nonsense will go away."]],[2054,["Who is higher and lower?"]],[2056,["Like some hairs are here and some are here;","are they higher or lower?"]],[2060,["You can’t do without this or this!"]],[2063,["It is an absurd idea that has come into our","heads that we are higher or lower."]],[2068,["So a gruhalakshmi is the one who has to be","a noble woman, has to be an example in the"]],[2076,["family."]],[2077,["Like, if a housewife herself is a drunkard,","marries ten times, what will happen to her"]],[2083,["children?"]],[2084,["Just think of it, such a woman."]],[2086,["A woman who has no sense of chastity, no sense","of auspiciousness, no sense of protection"]],[2096,["for them, what can she talk?"]],[2100,["Who is she?"]],[2101,["What does it matter?"]],[2102,["I mean what comfort can anybody give to a","housewife?"]],[2105,["She is the one who is the source of comfort;","what comfort can you give her?"]],[2109,["To her the greatest comfort is that you eat","your food properly, you sleep well, you keep"]],[2112,["well; that is the greatest comfort."]],[2115,["So this is what one has to know: that gruhalakshmi","is the woman in the family, she is the gruhalakshmi."]],[2128,["But the man should not be a wolf also."]],[2130,["A gruhalakshmi cannot marry a wolf, you must","understand."]],[2132,["If the man is a wolf, then he doesn’t deserve","to have a gruhalakshmi, but he can have a"]],[2140,["she-wolf as his wife; that’s a good idea."]],[2142,["Then they can fight, quarrel, have all kinds","of divorces, this thing."]],[2147,["But it’s the responsibility of the gruhalakshmi,","to begin with I must tell you."]],[2150,["To keep the balance it is her duty."]],[2153,["It is not the duty of the other people in","the family."]],[2159,["It is she who keeps."]],[2161,["She doesn’t give up at any cost."]],[2162,["Of course, if he’s a wolf: all right, he","can go to the forest."]],[2165,["She’s not bothered."]],[2167,["But the men must understand [that] the more","you start respecting the housewife, the gruhalakshmi,"]],[2174,["in the family, the more there is respect,","the more there will be settling of these women"]],[2181,["in their proper places, becoming proud of","their houses and families and their own set"]],[2188,["up that they have put in."]],[2189,["They’ll feel they’ll have a meaning, and","the whole society will change."]],[2194,["But if the men run after dirty women and cheap","and street women, then the same housewives"]],[2199,["can take to that."]],[2201,["So that is very important, that they must","be respected, because they are gruhalakshmis."]],[2211,["That is one thing."]],[2213,["The second thing is, they are also rajalakshmis."]],[2220,["Rajalakshmis are the goddesses who are looking","after the country."]],[2229,["Like England has a Rajalakshmi too."]],[2232,["Now, we say, we can say, the princess now","(Princess Diana) is, she’s a rajalakshmi."]],[2240,["She is a woman with dignity."]],[2243,["She carries herself with that bashful sweetness","and all that, she’s a rajalakshmi."]],[2246,["Our Queen is very good too."]],[2248,["But, we can say, other people in the same","family are funny."]],[2254,["They belong to Royal family [but] they haven’t","got that strength of character to belong to"]],[2259,["that."]],[2260,["They have all the privileges, but they think","they have all the rights, but no duties."]],[2264,["And as that also the rajalakshmi can be very","funny."]],[2268,["Like in this country there has been curses","on curses, because of seven queens were murdered"]],[2273,["in this country."]],[2274,["I mean, I can’t think of any country where","even one queen can be murdered by the king."]],[2281,["This country has a very funny curse of these","seven women who were killed like this."]],[2285,["I mean, what sort of women they must have","been, and what sort of queens they must have"]],[2291,["been?"]],[2292,["I mean, there’s nothing of a rajalakshmi."]],[2295,["A rajalakshmi is a dignified woman."]],[2297,["She is the one who is the glory of the country."]],[2300,["She has to be a glorious woman."]],[2302,["She has to be a woman with all the attributes","of a queen."]],[2310,["And that is the Rajalakshmi: is the, is the","queen, or the goddess, that is the queen;"]],[2315,["and She resides in every country."]],[2320,["Every country has a Gruhalakshmi, and if that","is insulted, then the people suffer."]],[2326,["They will suffer in so many ways, like they","will have money problems, they’ll have financial"]],[2332,["problems, they’ll have also have problems","of society; all kinds."]],[2335,["Because whatever the queen does, whatever","the king does, it is done by others; but specially"]],[2342,["the queen."]],[2343,["Most of the fashions in England have come","because the queen started it."]],[2348,["So whatever she does, she’s so important","and she has to have that idea in her that"]],[2354,["she’s the goddess."]],[2355,["She has to represent that goddess which resides","in every country."]],[2360,["So that is the Rajalakshmi."]],[2361,["Now, in countries where there is no [monarch],","in democratic countries, then all right, then"]],[2369,["the first lady of the country should behave."]],[2371,["Not like the American lady (Jackie Kennedy)","who married a tycoon somewhere, an old man,"]],[2378,["and is now a photographer!"]],[2379,["What is this?"]],[2380,["So cheap, it is so cheap!"]],[2381,["She doesn’t deserve to be there."]],[2384,["There’s no dignity about her."]],[2386,["She’s competing herself with cheap street","women."]],[2389,["She should know that she is the first lady."]],[2392,["In the countries where there is even, say,","not democracy, and other sorts of governments"]],[2399,["are there, there is also a first lady."]],[2401,["And why now these first ladies also have become","competitors and they compete there with their"]],[2406,["husbands and try."]],[2407,["Wherever they have tried such a trick: Even","Bandaranaike tried these things; she failed."]],[2412,["Anywhere they tried to outwit their husbands","by this, they will failed, because God is"]],[2417,["not with them."]],[2419,["They are there because they are first ladies,","and they should take all pride within themselves."]],[2423,["Even if they feel they are a little bit let","down by people, not respected."]],[2426,["But if she respects herself, nobody can be","disrespectful to her."]],[2429,["She should keep her respect and everybody","will respect her."]],[2432,["But just to punish people, if she has to behave","like this, that means she has no value of"]],[2437,["her own."]],[2439,["So the first thing that one, Lakshmi, gives","you [is] the value system."]],[2443,["Your value system is corrected."]],[2446,["You evaluate yourself properly."]],[2448,["Like, you know the value of this and value","of that and value of this."]],[2453,["But the value system for a divine person is","not based on the amount of money or amount"]],[2460,["of matter it has, but it depends on what vibrations","it has."]],[2465,["So the whole evaluation system changes when","you get into Divine temperament, that you"]],[2471,["start seeing things."]],[2473,["What is precious is what has the maximum vibrations."]],[2480,["Whatever has vibrations is the precious thing","for a realised-soul, and not what is not Divine."]],[2492,["What is not Divine, we have nothing to do","with."]],[2496,["But you will be amazed, whatever is Divine","is all very precious, also, otherwise."]],[2505,["Like the paintings, which are done with Divinity","—means the realised-souls have done — are"]],[2510,["today very expensive."]],[2511,["May not be in those days, but now, today."]],[2514,["Actually all the truth comes up gradually,","and people can see that clearly, that there"]],[2519,["is something special about these things."]],[2523,["So your value system changes as your Mahalakshmi","essence starts growing and manifesting."]],[2526,["You stand absolutely open, and you find that","new things, new ideas, a new valuation of"]],[2539,["everything starts coming to you."]],[2544,["Once this happens to you, know that you are","growing."]],[2554,["You must know how to judge whether you are","growing or not."]],[2560,["And that is how you will know that you are","growing in the right direction, if your value"]],[2567,["system is improving."]],[2570,["Today’s day is the Lakshmi’s day."]],[2574,["I bless you with all the Lakshmi’s powers."]],[2584,["And specially the discretion to improve your","value system: what is more valuable to you,"]],[2593,["what is the most valuable thing to you; you","must try to revise that."]],[2599,["Then there is, after this day, when they worship","the first day is, they say that, that is the"]],[2610,["day when Diwali was celebrated when Rama was","made the king."]],[2612,["He killed Ravana on Dashera."]],[2614,["And [it was] on this day that Rama was crowned,","and that’s why they celebrate it."]],[2620,["Now, Rama is the person — at that time He","was crowned — He represents the Benevolent"]],[2625,["King."]],[2626,["And the benevolence of a king is being crowned."]],[2627,["So that’s why they celebrate Diwali."]],[2628,["But we have a special significance of Diwali,","it’s a very special significance, I think:"]],[2633,["that the light, that we see here, you will","see it always goes upward."]],[2643,["The fire is the element that always goes upward."]],[2650,["It’s always against the gravity, and it","is against all that pulls you down."]],[2657,["And the light of the Spirit is also like that,","it always takes you upward."]],[2664,["And the person who is a realised-soul is called","as an enlightened person, because he has the"]],[2673,["light."]],[2674,["And the light has a capacity to give you a","full idea, to see what is what, to relate"]],[2680,["to each other, to find out the distances,","and the differences, and to discriminate."]],[2685,["So the light represents discrimination."]],[2690,["And when you are enlightened, the Spirit is","enlightened: in the sense [that] Spirit is"]],[2698,["the light, but which starts expressing itself","in the atmosphere, manifesting in the attention"]],[2705,["of yours."]],[2707,["Now, what we have done, in Sahaja Yoga, is","nothing but this is Diwali."]],[2712,["First one light was enlightened, then that","light enlightened another light, and now we"]],[2719,["have so many lights."]],[2720,["This is the Diwali that I have."]],[2723,["I enjoy this Diwali [more] than anything else."]],[2726,["Now some lights are really sometimes flickering,","I know that."]],[2729,["Doesn’t matter."]],[2730,["Some lights are afraid of the wind that might","affect it, so I have to look after them."]],[2740,["In India you see this part is called as ‘achal","of the mother’, you see, where she keeps"]],[2745,["her child hidden."]],[2747,["And this is where she looks after the candle","also, the light that she has kindled."]],[2752,["And very carefully she looks after it and","tries to see again and again if it is burning"]],[2758,["or not."]],[2759,["And when she is sure that it is burning nicely,","then she puts it on a higher place where it"]],[2767,["burns; not for itself but for others."]],[2770,["It enlightens others and enlightens the path","of the people who are going in the darkness."]],[2777,["So, for us, Sahaja Yoga today, is a Mahayoga,","because it is the Deepavali."]],[2782,["It’s not only one deepa of your Mother burning,","but it’s so many lights all over the world."]],[2789,["You know they have taken their light and they","are burning."]],[2794,["Even small children are giving Realisation."]],[2796,["It has spread to the villages now, and is","spreading slowly as the Diwali."]],[2803,["And every day we celebrate Diwali we have","more and more lights."]],[2807,["And I am sure these lights are going to grow."]],[2811,["Those people, who still have flickering lights,","have problems, they always have problems,"]],[2817,["and they must know that their light is to","be brought in properly, into proper shape."]],[2822,["They must put all attention to put their lights","in order."]],[2829,["If your lights are ordered there cannot be","a problem, there cannot be a problem."]],[2835,["So the correction is also a Divine quality","in you, which should work inward, by which"]],[2842,["you correct yourself."]],[2843,["And the other day I was explaining how you","don’t have to think."]],[2847,["It’s very simple."]],[2848,["It’s a machinery, which is a Divine machinery,","which you have found out now, within yourself."]],[2854,["Now at this time when you have got a machinery,","you don’t have to think about it."]],[2858,["Because the machinery that is Divine, is just","like any other machinery."]],[2864,["For example, you know the machinery of the","car, you don’t have to think."]],[2867,["You don’t think, “I have to put a brake,”","you just put it."]],[2869,["When you are a master driver, you just do","it, you don’t think."]],[2872,["Do you think?"]],[2873,["If you start thinking, you will kill so many","people by that thinking!"]],[2876,["So in the same way, if you have mastered this","machinery: if you know which one to move,"]],[2881,["how to move, how to work it out, if you have","mastered it you don’t think about it and"]],[2886,["it just works."]],[2887,["And that is what it is and we have to understand","that, after developing Mahalakshmi tattwa,"]],[2892,["which is the main tattwa, which is the evolutionary","principle by which you have evolved."]],[2899,["It’s the ultimate, the Sushumna, the central","path, which is the most important."]],[2906,["If the Sushumna is not all right, then you","cannot do anything, because there is the flow,"]],[2912,["there is the opening, which is important,","which makes you wider, which makes you deeper,"]],[2920,["which makes you greater."]],[2924,["That is the path of Sushumna which must be","always kept open."]],[2929,["You must try to keep it open: by balancing","yourself, by this generous attitude, and by"]],[2937,["seeing everything through your discretion."]],[2941,["Keep it open."]],[2943,["Keep your Sushumna open."]],[2946,["And that is the path of Mahalakshmi."]],[2949,["If you keep your Sushumna open there will","be no physical problems, no emotional problems,"]],[2956,["and of course no spiritual problems."]],[2959,["That is how one has to understand today’s","Mahalakshmi tattwa."]],[2962,["Now at this position when you reach, you see:","this position is very important at Mahalakshmi’s"]],[2969,["principle, is that it gives you the witness","state, no doubt."]],[2973,["But as I have told you before, just after","this first day’s puja of the Lakshmi, when"]],[2980,["Rama was crowned, next day they have the second","day."]],[2986,["And on this second day, you see the thirteenth","day, as I told you, is the day when the Lakshmi"]],[2995,["was born."]],[2996,["Fourteenth day is a horrible thing, which","I do not want to tell you much about, because"]],[2999,["that is the day the Goddess had to fight all","the horrible rakshasas."]],[3003,["So I don’t want to talk about it much because","you know all that."]],[3009,["That is the fourteenth day."]],[3012,["Then the fifteenth day is the day when the","moon is absolutely missing from everything."]],[3015,["It’s absolute darkness, where you put these","lights to suggest that: there are lights now,"]],[3021,["let Lakshmi come within us."]],[3024,["So there is no spot that should be left which","is dark."]],[3028,["So everywhere the Lakshmi resides, and give","us the glory of Her blessings."]],[3033,["Then it is the night when you have the dark","night, as you call it, amavasya."]],[3042,["Then the first night after that, is the first","moon that the, you say the new moon."]],[3053,["[When] the new moon comes up, the first day,","is the day when the New Year starts for Shalivahana."]],[3058,["As you know, Shalivahanas are my ancestors,","or whatever you call it, the same Dynasty."]],[3064,["That is the day."]],[3066,["That day, they take a shawl, shawl of the","Mother, like this, and put this water carrier"]],[3076,["on top, to suggest the Aquarius time."]],[3080,["The Aquarius time has started according to","them."]],[3082,["They put that on top of that, and put it,","like a flag, on top of their houses to suggest"]],[3089,["now the Aquarius time is there."]],[3091,["With the Mother’s shawl they made the flag."]],[3096,["And on top of the flag is the water carrier,","is put upside down to suggest that the Aquarius"]],[3103,["time has started, that the time of Kundalini","has started, and that this awakening has to"]],[3110,["take place."]],[3111,["That’s the first day of the year they start."]],[3116,["Then after that, the second day is..so it","is five days actually; but why I said four"]],[3122,["days celebration is because one day is a horrid","day in between."]],[3127,["But also there’s a celebration because,","after killing all these rakshasas, there were"]],[3132,["Diwali."]],[3133,["Many a times these things happened, and every","time She killed all these rakshasas they celebrated"]],[3138,["it by putting lights all around."]],[3141,["So after that is the second day, is very important,","which is here: is the brother and sister’s"]],[3148,["special day, where the sister invites the","brother to her house for food."]],[3152,["And if he’s a small boy she will give him","a bath."]],[3156,["Even if he is a big boy he sits with all his","clothes on and she puts water on him and puts"]],[3164,["something, very fragrant things, on his body","and gives him a bath nicely and gives him"]],[3167,["a protection."]],[3168,["It’s a purity of relationship between","a sister and a brother."]],[3178,["And then the brother gives her something as","a present at that time."]],[3184,["And he may give anything: it’s just symbolic."]],[3187,["It’s the love and affection of a brother","and sister [which] is expressed at that time."]],[3195,["It’s very important."]],[3198,["And then the sister, actually gives him a","bandhan, with actual light, which we call"]],[3201,["as the aarti they do for the brother."]],[3203,["And that’s how they try to give a big protection","to their brother."]],[3204,["So this is the day, they call it in Marathi","‘Bhaubeej’ or ‘Bhaiyadweej’: that"]],[3207,["is the dwitya, the second day of the moon."]],[3208,["That is done in India."]],[3209,["Now it has significance because it is very","important that our relationship as a brother"]],[3221,["and a sister must be strengthened, must be","purified, must be looked after."]],[3227,["In India, even if somebody calls you a sister","or a brother, then he is a sister or a brother."]],[3232,["It’s a very difficult situation."]],[3233,["If somebody calls you a sister, then you have","to accept that situation."]],[3237,["And if you accept that situation, all your","life you have to carry on that relationship"]],[3242,["of that nobility."]],[3243,["Whether he may be your brother or not, doesn’t","matter."]],[3245,["She may your sister or not, does not matter."]],[3247,["But once you have said she is your sister,","then all that purity is there, all her chastity"]],[3250,["is to be protected, and she is to be looked","after."]],[3254,["So this is how it is."]],[3259,["These are the five days they celebrate."]],[3263,["In short I have told you, how we Sahaja yogis","should understand, these five days are days"]],[3265,["of real festival for us because we have overcome","death now, we have overcome that degradation"]],[3272,["that would have followed after it."]],[3274,["Now we are people who are victorious."]],[3278,["So this is to celebrate our victory over evil,","our victory over our weaknesses, and our victory"]],[3287,["towards the goal of our achievement — that","is full Self-realisation."]],[3293,["And that’s how it’s a great day of celebration,","and may God bless you all."]],[3296,["And in this jubilation I join you all, and","I am very happy that we are so many today"]],[3304,["in this country, and a day will come when","we, our righteousness and our greatness will"]],[3314,["definitely enhance the path of darkness with","this light, and improve the conditions, to"]],[3328,["such an extent that people won’t believe","that they were living in this wretched world,"]],[3329,["and today they are in such a beautiful world."]],[3330,["They won’t believe."]],[3331,["It will happen."]],[3332,["As it has happened within yourself it will","happen without."]],[3333,["And that’s what is the day I am waiting","for, when such things will happen."]],[3336,["And all these things we are doing here, leading","a very righteous and a good life now, with"]],[3341,["forgiveness for others and with all the generosity:","it will became a universal truth for people."]],[3344,["And when this will become a universal happening,","and when people will universally accept Sahaja"]],[3350,["Yoga, then will be the real days of Diwali’s","celebration."]],[3354,["May God bless you all."]],[3356,["So I must say, for Christmas I won’t be","here."]],[3358,["I’ll be in India."]],[3359,["It’s nice way, you know, because I’ll","escape all your presents! (laughter) You gave"]],[3363,["me so many presents last time that it was","too much for me."]],[3371,["Of course if you say that, I gave you, because","that’s of course is nothing great because,"]],[3389,["you see, if you give to one person, it is","too much to carry."]],[3397,["They say you have to have a shipload."]],[3407,["And if one person gives to so many, it’s","not such a difficult thing, isn’t it."]],[3411,["But if everybody gives to one person it’s","too much."]],[3414,["And if one person gives to many it’s very","good because the load is lessened on everyone"]],[3419,["and also shared, of that one person."]],[3423,["So my giving was a better thing than your","giving to me, because I was really thinking"]],[3428,["of taking a ship, to put all the nice presents","you gave me."]],[3436,["So, do you have any questions?"]],[3452,["So, now, just, this is your ring."]],[3494,["Kay, here’s the ring."]],[3507,["Simon, come along!"]],[3509,["So, you see, today’s puja is more sort of","asking for the expansion, expansion of your"]],[3519,["Sushumna; more that."]],[3521,["So as it is, when we are doing this puja,","first of all you must develop a mood of forgiving"]],[3530,["others, and forgiving yourself also; just","that mood, first of all, to improve your Sushumna"]],[3537,["further to grow, first of all."]],[3540,["So there’s a mantra for that, “Ya Devi","Sarvabhuteshu kshama rupena samsthitah.\""]],[3546,["All right?"]],[3547,["And, “Shanti ripen samstitah.\""]],[3550,["All these mantras, if you say, all of you,","if you say these mantras: one you can say"]],[3562,["and they can repeat you."]],[3567,["And then that will definitely improve."]],[3575,["These are all mantras for the Sushumna."]],[3579,["I think you people don’t have any machine,","a grinding machine in the thing."]],[3590,["So I had better pay for that machine."]],[3591,["Because I would like to give some present","to the ashram."]],[3594,["And what do you call that machine for grinding","something?"]],[3597,["Yogi: A grinder, Shri Mataji."]],[3598,["Shri Mataji: Become something greater and","higher."]],[3600,["That’s the point is."]]]);
